The runtime runs as a separate executable. It is not linked into the
GPLv3 game guest or Apache framework. Its downloaded sources, dependencies
and binaries stay in ignored .deps/; native test captures stay in build/.
This directory and the native emulator helpers are excluded from the
curated hosted/public guest-source exports. There is no public runtime
distribution or licence-compatibility clearance for such a distribution.
